// padStart, padEnd, repeat, reverse and concatWith in a grouped query: a padded group key, report lines of
// fixed width with a bar of repeated characters over count, concatWith over aggregates and inside a selector,
// reverse in a predicate, and a padded count as a sort key.
{
  "from": { "entity": "users" },
  "groupBy": [
    {
      "alias": "country",
      "expression": { "source": "users", "field": "country", "type": { "name": "string" } }
    },
    {
      "alias": "tier",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "padStart",
        "type": { "name": "string" },
        "operand": { "source": "users", "field": "tier", "type": { "name": "string" } },
        "length": { "type": { "name": "integer" }, "value": 2 },
        "fill": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "0" }
      }
    }
  ],
  "having": {
    "operator": "greaterThan",
    "type": { "name": "boolean" },
    "left": {
      "operator": "length",
      "type": { "name": "integer" },
      "operand": {
        "operator": "repeat",
        "type": { "name": "string" },
        "operand": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "#" },
        "count": { "operator": "count", "type": { "name": "integer" } }
      }
    },
    "right": { "type": { "name": "integer" }, "value": 1 }
  },
  "select": [
    {
      "alias": "line",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "concat",
        "type": { "name": "string" },
        "values": [
          {
            "operator": "padEnd",
            "type": { "name": "string" },
            "operand": { "key": "country", "type": { "name": "string" } },
            "length": { "type": { "name": "integer" }, "value": 12 },
            "fill": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": " " }
          },
          {
            "operator": "padStart",
            "type": { "name": "string" },
            "operand": {
              "operator": "asString",
              "type": { "name": "string" },
              "operand": { "operator": "count", "type": { "name": "integer" } }
            },
            "length": { "type": { "name": "integer" }, "value": 6 },
            "fill": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": " " }
          },
          { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": " " },
          {
            "operator": "repeat",
            "type": { "name": "string" },
            "operand": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "#" },
            "count": { "operator": "count", "type": { "name": "integer" } }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    { "alias": "tier", "expression": { "key": "tier", "type": { "name": "string" } } },
    {
      "alias": "name_range",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "concatWith",
        "type": { "name": "string" },
        "values": [
          {
            "operator": "min",
            "type": { "name": "string" },
            "selector": { "source": "users", "field": "last_name", "type": { "name": "string" } }
          },
          {
            "operator": "max",
            "type": { "name": "string" },
            "selector": { "source": "users", "field": "last_name", "type": { "name": "string" } }
          }
        ],
        "separator": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": " … " }
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "longest_full_name",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "max",
        "type": { "name": "integer" },
        "selector": {
          "operator": "length",
          "type": { "name": "integer" },
          "operand": {
            "operator": "concatWith",
            "type": { "name": "string" },
            "values": [
              { "source": "users", "field": "first_name", "type": { "name": "string" } },
              { "source": "users", "field": "middle_name", "type": { "name": "string", "nullable": true } },
              { "source": "users", "field": "last_name", "type": { "name": "string" } }
            ],
            "separator": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": " " }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "palindromes",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "count",
        "type": { "name": "integer" },
        "predicate": {
          "operator": "equal",
          "type": { "name": "boolean" },
          "left": {
            "operator": "reverse",
            "type": { "name": "string" },
            "operand": {
              "operator": "lower",
              "type": { "name": "string" },
              "operand": { "source": "users", "field": "first_name", "type": { "name": "string" } }
            }
          },
          "right": {
            "operator": "lower",
            "type": { "name": "string" },
            "operand": { "source": "users", "field": "first_name", "type": { "name": "string" } }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "country_backwards",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "reverse",
        "type": { "name": "string" },
        "operand": { "key": "country", "type": { "name": "string" } }
      }
    }
  ],
  "orderBy": [
    {
      "expression": {
        "operator": "padStart",
        "type": { "name": "string" },
        "operand": {
          "operator": "asString",
          "type": { "name": "string" },
          "operand": { "operator": "count", "type": { "name": "integer" } }
        },
        "length": { "type": { "name": "integer" }, "value": 6 },
        "fill": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "0" }
      },
      "direction": "desc"
    },
    { "expression": { "key": "country", "type": { "name": "string" } } },
    { "expression": { "key": "tier", "type": { "name": "string" } } }
  ]
}
